sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a straight line touches a circle, and from the point of contact a straight line is drawn at right angles to the tangent, the center of the circle will be on the straight line so drawn.
----
proof:

For let a straight line {DE} touch the circle {ABC} at the point {C}. Draw {CA} from {C} at right angles to {DE}. [!just I.11]

